// Botão fechar — sempre com aria-label:
<button onClick={onClose} aria-label="Fechar" style={{ background: "none", border: "none", cursor: "pointer", color: t.textMuted, display: "flex", alignItems: "center", padding: 4 }}>
  <X size={18} />
</button>
```

